npc_level2: "...You’re their kid, aren’t you?"
"You knew my family"
npc_level2: "I lived two floors below them. I remember the night they disappeared"
"What happened?"
npc_level2: "I saw someone come to their apartment that night."
if personality.best_name == "Selfish":
	"Then tell me what you know. I don't have time to waste."
	npc_level2: "You came back after all these years and the first thing you ask for is information."
	"You know something I need. That's what matters."
	npc_level2: "...Fair enough."
	"Who came to the apartment?"
	npc_level2: "A man in a gray coat. He wasn't from the neighborhood."
	"Did he leave alone?"
	npc_level2: "No. Your family left with him."
	"Where did they go?"
	npc_level2: "I saw a black transport waiting outside."
	"Do you remember anything else?"
	npc_level2: "There was a symbol on its side. A white triangle with a line through it."
if personality.best_name == "Empathy":
	"You look like you’ve been carrying this for a long time."
	npc_level2: "...Maybe I have."
	"You were there that night, weren't you?"
	npc_level2: "I saw them leave."
	"Was everyone okay?"
	npc_level2: "Your mother was crying. Your father kept telling everyone to stay calm."
	"And you couldn't do anything."
	npc_level2: "I was afraid. I locked my door and listened."
	"You don't have to blame yourself."
	npc_level2: "That's the thing. I should have done something."
	"What do you remember?"
	npc_level2: "Your younger sister kept asking where they were going."
	"Did someone answer her?"
	npc_level2: "The man did. He told her, 'You'll see your home again.'"
	"Home again...?"
	npc_level2: "Those were his exact words."
if personality.best_name == "Aggressive":
	"You knew something happened. Start talking."
	npc_level2: "I told you, I don't want trouble."
	"Neither do I. So stop hiding things."
	npc_level2: "Lower your voice."
	"Who came to their apartment?"
	npc_level2: "I don't know."
	"You saw him."
	npc_level2: "...Yes."
	"Then stop lying."
	npc_level2: "Fine! He showed me an identification badge."
	"What was on it?"
	npc_level2: "I don't remember the name."
	"Then remember the symbol."
	npc_level2: "Black circle. Three vertical lines through it."
	"And then?"
	npc_level2: "He told your family they were being relocated."
	"Relocated where?"
	npc_level2: "I don't know!"
	"You'd better hope that's true."
if personality.best_name == "Brave":
	"You said you saw someone. Why haven't you told anyone?"
	npc_level2: "Because people have disappeared for saying less."
	"I've already lost my family. I'm not walking away because I'm scared."
	npc_level2: "...That's exactly what your father used to say."
	"You knew him well?"
	npc_level2: "Not well. But I remember that night."
	"Tell me everything."
	npc_level2: "The man who came for them wasn't alone."
	"How many?"
	npc_level2: "Three. Your family. The man. And someone wearing a security uniform."
	"Security from where?"
	npc_level2: "I couldn't see the insignia clearly."
	"What happened after they left?"
	npc_level2: "I followed them to the street."
	"You followed them?"
	npc_level2: "For about a block."
	"And?"
	npc_level2: "They got into a transport and drove toward the old industrial district."
	"Why didn't you tell me this before?"
	npc_level2: "Because I was afraid you'd go looking."
	"I'm going to."
	npc_level2: "...I figured you would."